---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionScrollNav from '../components/SectionScrollNav.vue';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { NAV_HOME_BASE } from '../data/site';

const lastUpdated = 'September 2026';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Slovenia Games Conference 2027">
  <SectionScrollNav client:load base={NAV_HOME_BASE} />

  <main class="legal-page">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="container legal-hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Slovenia Games Conference 2027</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-body-section">
      <div class="container legal-body">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how the Slovenia Games Association ("we", "us", or
          "our") collects, uses, and protects your personal data when you visit the Slovenia
          Games Conference website (the "Site") or register for the Slovenia Games Conference
          2027 (the "Conference"). We process personal data in accordance with the EU General
          Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and applicable Slovenian data protection law.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          The data controller responsible for your personal data is the Slovenia Games
          Association, organiser of the Slovenia Games Conference, based in Ljubljana, Slovenia.
          You can reach us at <a href="mailto:info@sgc.si">info@sgc.si</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> your name, email address, and any details you provide when you sign up for our newsletter, register for the Conference, or contact us.</li>
          <li><strong>Ticketing information:</strong> where tickets are sold, order and billing details are processed by our ticketing provider on our behalf.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical information:</strong> basic, non-identifying data such as your browser type and pages visited, collected automatically to help us operate and improve the Site.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To register you for the Conference and manage your attendance.</li>
          <li>To send you the newsletter and updates about the Conference, where you have signed up.</li>
          <li>To respond to your enquiries and provide support.</li>
          <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the Site and the event.</li>
          <li>To comply with our legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
        <p>
          We rely on the following legal bases under the GDPR: your <strong>consent</strong>
          (for example, for newsletter sign-ups, which you may withdraw at any time); the
          <strong>performance of a contract</strong> (to provide your ticket and manage your
          registration); our <strong>legitimate interests</strong> (to operate and improve the
          Site and event); and <strong>compliance with legal obligations</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Newsletter &amp; Communications</h2>
        <p>
          If you sign up for our newsletter, we will use your email address to send you updates
          about the Conference. Every email includes an option to unsubscribe, and you can opt out
          at any time by contacting us. Newsletter sign-ups are currently collected via a
          third-party form provider, which processes your submission on our behalf.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          The Site uses only the cookies and similar technologies necessary for it to function and,
          where applicable, to understand how the Site is used in aggregate. We do not use cookies
          to build advertising profiles. You can control or delete cookies through your browser
          settings; disabling essential cookies may affect how the Site works.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Sharing Your Data</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your personal data. We may share it with trusted service providers who
          help us run the Conference and the Site — such as ticketing, email, and hosting
          providers — who act on our instructions and are bound to protect your data. We may also
          disclose data where required by law.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We keep your personal data only for as long as necessary for the purposes described in
          this policy, or as required by law. Newsletter data is kept until you unsubscribe.
          Registration and ticketing data is kept for the period needed to run the event and to
          meet our legal and accounting obligations.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Under the GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>access the personal data we hold about you;</li>
          <li>request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data;</li>
          <li>request erasure of your data ("right to be forgotten");</li>
          <li>restrict or object to certain processing;</li>
          <li>request portability of the data you provided to us;</li>
          <li>withdraw consent at any time, where processing is based on consent.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:info@sgc.si">info@sgc.si</a>. You also have the right to lodge a
          complaint with the Slovenian Information Commissioner (Informacijski pooblaščenec).
        </p>

        <h2>10. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your personal data
          against loss, misuse, and unauthorised access. However, no method of transmission over
          the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The current version will always be
          available on this page, with the "Last updated" date shown above. We encourage you to
          review it periodically.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please
          contact us at <a href="mailto:info@sgc.si">info@sgc.si</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
.legal-page {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 100vh;
  background-color: #0f1419;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(255, 79, 18, 0.16), transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10, 12, 15, 0.62), rgba(10, 12, 15, 0.88)),
    url('/coming-soon-bg.jpg');
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-attachment: fixed;
}

.legal-hero { padding: 8.5rem 0 1.6rem; }
.legal-hero-inner { width: min(820px, 94%); }
.eyebrow { margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
.legal-hero h1 { margin: 0.45rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6vw, 4rem); line-height: 0.96; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #ffffff; font-family: "Space Grotesk", "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
.legal-updated { margin: 0.85rem 0 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 0.92rem; }

.legal-body-section { padding: 1rem 0 5rem; }
.legal-body {
  width: min(820px, 94%);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
  font-size: 1.02rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 2.6rem 2.8rem 2.8rem;
  box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
}
.legal-body > p:first-child { font-size: 1.08rem; color: #ffffff; }

.legal-body h2 {
  margin: 2.4rem 0 0.7rem;
  font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 1.55rem);
  color: #ffffff;
  font-family: "Space Grotesk", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.legal-body p { margin: 0.7rem 0 0; }
.legal-body ul { margin: 0.7rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.3rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.45rem; }
.legal-body li { line-height: 1.6; }
.legal-body strong { color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; }

.legal-body a { color: #ff8a5c; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
.legal-body a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
